EXT. SKYSCRAPER ROOFTOP - NIGHT - RAIN
[CAMERA: Dolly In 24mm Anamorphic | Lighting: High Contrast Neon Cyan]

Rain pelts against the gravel roof. AGENT VANCE (30s, tactical rig) crouches behind a ventilation shaft.

[CAMERA: Extreme Wide Shot | Motion: Pan Left]
A stealth chopper hovers three hundred feet above the city skyline, searchlights carving blinding cones through the downpour.

[CAMERA: Medium Close Up | Motion: Handheld Shaky Cam]
Vance checks the ammunition counter on his grappling rifle: 2 SHOTS REMAINING.

VANCE
(into throat mic)
Command, I'm pinned on the south ledge. Target package is secured.

[CAMERA: Dutch Angle Low Hero | Motion: Dolly Out Fast]
Three armored mercenary operatives burst through the steel roof access doors, laser sights cutting the rain.

LEAD MERCENARY
Drop the drive, Vance! There's nowhere to run!

[CAMERA: Extreme Close Up on Eyes | Motion: Slow Motion 120fps]
Vance's eyes narrow. He smiles in the neon glare.

VANCE
Who said anything about running?

[CAMERA: Full Crane Down Sweep | Motion: Pan Right Fast]
Vance leaps backwards off the ninety-story skyscraper ledge into the open rain-filled abyss, firing his grapple into the passing sky-train below!
